    ([38;5;153mtest_chunk_text_even_split[39m, [38;5;153mtest_chunk_text_uneven_tail[39m) reproduced the bug before the change and pass after it; no
    other test regressed.
  - [38;5;153mruff check[39m and [38;5;153mmypy[39m on the changed file both clean.

